rows.quote_en:
Thus, the decision on the need to set up a CMDS must consider several factors, such as:
- clinical and scientific relevance to the clinical trial;
- potential benefits and acceptable risks for the protection of the participants;
- type of population;
- design of the clinical trial, including objective(s) and endpoint(s);
[page 11 footer and page header]
- relevance of the committee to the integrity of the research.

rows.quote:
Um Evento Adverso Grave é considerado qualquer ocorrência médica adversa com produto
sob investigação, ocorrendo em qualquer dose e que resulte em qualquer um dos seguintes
(2025)
desfechos:
a) óbito;
2ª Edição
b) risco de morte;
c) incapacidade/invalidez persistente ou significativa;
d) exige internação hospitalar ou prolonga internação;
e) anomalia congênita ou defeito de nascimento;
f) evento clinicamente significativo.

rows.quote_en:
A Serious Adverse Event is considered to be any untoward medical occurrence with a product under investigation, occurring at any dose, that results in any of the following outcomes:
a) death;
b) risk of death;
c) persistent or significant incapacity/disability;
d) requires hospitalisation or prolongs hospitalisation;
e) congenital anomaly or birth defect;
f) clinically significant event.
